=2 Walkthrough
* With your {i:Signal Pearl|Signal Pearl|14810} or {i:Tactics Pearl|Tactics Pearl|14811} in your inventory but **NOT** equipped, speak to {n:Ratoto} by the Upper Jeuno Guide Stone at (I-10).
* Afterwards, speak to Luto.
* Go to {z:Southern San d'Oria} and speak to {n:Raimbroy} at (E-8). (Located inside Raimbroy's Grocery)
* Return to Luto for another cutscene.
* Head to Map 2 (M-8) in {z:Beadeaux}, enter {z:Qulun Dome} and check the ??? spot at (I-6) for a cutscene. (The same ??? spot for {q:Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind|Whence Blows the Wind}, Genkai 3.)
* Return to Luto for a cutscene that completes the quest.

